#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1225
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>View Statusbar</guimenuitem> — The <guimenuitem>View "
"Statusbar</guimenuitem> menu item determines whether to display the status "
"bar and information area at the bottom of each worksheets. Selecting the "
"menu item toggles the check mark in front. When this menu item has the "
"checkmark, <application>Gnumeric</application> will display the statusbar."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Visa statusrad</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet <guimenuitem>Visa "
"statusrad</guimenuitem> avgör om statusraden och informationsområdet visas "
"längst ned på varje kalkylblad. När du väljer menyobjektet växlar "
"markeringen. Om objektet är markerat visar "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> statusraden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1236
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Full Screen</guimenuitem> — The <guimenuitem>Full "
"Screen</guimenuitem> menu item changes the display of "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> from a window based display to a display"
" which occupies the whole screen. In full screen mode, the window borders "
"will not be displayed nor will the toolbars. The key <keysym>F11</keysym> "
"toggles between full screen and regular display mode. When this menu item "
"has the checkmark, <application>Gnumeric</application> is in "
"<guimenuitem>Full Screen</guimenuitem> mode."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Helskärm</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet "
"<guimenuitem>Helskärm</guimenuitem> växlar "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> från fönsterläge till helskärmsläge. I "
"helskärmsläge visas varken fönsterramar eller verktygsfält. Tangenten "
"<keysym>F11</keysym> växlar mellan helskärmsläge och vanligt visningsläge. "
"När menyobjektet är markerat är <application>Gnumeric</application> i läget "
"<guimenuitem>Helskärm</guimenuitem>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1249
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>View Properties...</guimenuitem> — The <guimenuitem>View "
"Properties...</guimenuitem> menu item opens the <guimenuitem>View "
"Properties</guimenuitem> dialog."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Visningsegenskaper…</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet "
"<guimenuitem>Visningsegenskaper…</guimenuitem> öppnar dialogrutan "
"<guimenuitem>Visningsegenskaper</guimenuitem>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1258
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/menu-view-properties-"
"dialog.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the View "
"Properties dialog.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/menu-view-properties-"
"dialog.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Dialogrutan "
"Visningsegenskaper.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1269
msgid ""
"The <guimenu>View Properties</guimenu> dialog has four tabs. <guimenu>Auto "
"Completion </guimenu>is described in <xref linkend=\"sect-worksheets-"
"settings\"/>, <guimenu>Protection</guimenu> in <xref linkend=\"sect-"
"worksheets-settings-protection\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Dialogrutan <guimenu>Visningsegenskaper</guimenu> har fyra flikar. Fliken "
"<guimenu>Autokomplettera </guimenu> beskrivs i <xref linkend=\"sect-"
"worksheets-settings\"/> och fliken <guimenu>Skydd</guimenu> i <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-worksheets-settings-protection\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1277
msgid ""
"The <guimenu>View Properties</guimenu> dialog, <guimenu>Cell "
"Markers</guimenu> tab"
msgstr ""
"Dialogrutan <guimenu>Visningsegenskaper</guimenu>, fliken "
"<guimenu>Cellmarkörer</guimenu>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1279
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/menu-view-properties-dialog-"
"cm.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the Cell Markers "
"tab of the View Properties dialog.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/menu-view-properties-dialog-"
"cm.png\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Fliken Cellmarkörer i "
"dialogrutan Visningsegenskaper.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1290
msgid ""
"The check boxes on the <guimenu>Cell Markers</guimenu> tab shown in <xref "
"linkend=\"menu-view-properties-dialog-cm.png\"/> determine whether cells are"
" shown with indicators that they contain formulae and/or that they have "
"clipped content."
msgstr ""
"Kryssrutorna på fliken <guimenu>Cellmarkörer</guimenu>, som visas i <xref "
"linkend=\"menu-view-properties-dialog-cm.png\"/>, avgör om celler markeras "
"när de innehåller formler eller innehåll som inte visas helt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1296
msgid ""
"The check boxes on the <guimenu>Widget</guimenu> tab shown in <xref "
"linkend=\"menu-view-properties-dialog.png\"/> determine whether the notebook"
" tabs, the horizontal scrollbar and/or the vertical scrollbars are shown in "
"this view."
msgstr ""
"Kryssrutorna på fliken <guimenu>Gränssnittskomponenter</guimenu>, som visas "
"i <xref linkend=\"menu-view-properties-dialog.png\"/>, avgör om "
"kalkylbladsflikarna, den vågräta rullningslisten och de lodräta "
"rullningslisterna visas i den här vyn."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1311 C/gnumeric.xml:1936
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Zoom...</guimenuitem> opens a dialog where you can set the "
"magnification of one or more worksheets in the current workbook."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Zooma…</guimenuitem> öppnar en dialogruta där du kan ställa in "
"förstoringen för ett eller flera kalkylblad i den aktuella arbetsboken."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1334
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/menu-insert-labelled.png\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the Insert menu.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/menu-insert-labelled.png\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av menyn Infoga.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1363
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Cells...</guimenuitem> — The "
"<guimenuitem>Cells...</guimenuitem> menu item opens a dialog asking the user"
" how the sheet should be altered when new cells are inserted. The dialog "
"lists four choices. The user can choose one of these by clicking the mouse "
"pointer on one of the four dots. Only one choice is possible and the "
"currently selected choice has a black dot in front."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Infoga celler…</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet <guimenuitem>Infoga"
" celler…</guimenuitem> öppnar en dialogruta där du väljer hur kalkylbladet "
"ska ändras när nya celler infogas. Dialogrutan visar fyra alternativ. Välj "
"ett genom att klicka på motsvarande alternativknapp. Du kan bara välja ett "
"alternativ åt gången; det valda alternativet markeras med en svart punkt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1373
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Shift cells right</guilabel> will insert a region of new cells"
" of the size of the current selection. Cells which are on the same row as "
"the selection and within or to the right of the selection will shift over to"
" the right to accommodate the new cells. The <guilabel>Shift cells "
"down</guilabel> choice will also insert a region of new cells the same size "
"as the current selection. With this choice, cells which are in the selection"
" or below the selection will move down to accommodate the new cells. The two"
" other choices will act as if the user had chosen to insert rows or columns."
" These actions are explained above."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Flytta celler åt höger</guilabel> infogar ett område med nya "
"celler som är lika stort som den aktuella markeringen. Celler på samma rader"
" som markeringen, inom den eller till höger om den flyttas åt höger för att "
"ge plats åt de nya cellerna. Alternativet <guilabel>Flytta celler "
"nedåt</guilabel> infogar också ett område som är lika stort som markeringen."
" Då flyttas cellerna i markeringen eller nedanför den nedåt. De två andra "
"alternativen fungerar som om du hade valt att infoga rader eller kolumner. "
"Dessa åtgärder beskrivs ovan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1390
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Columns</guimenuitem> — The <guimenuitem>Columns</guimenuitem> "
"menu item will insert columns to the left of the current selection. The "
"number of columns inserted will equal the number of columns spanned by the "
"current selection."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Kolumner</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet "
"<guimenuitem>Kolumner</guimenuitem> infogar kolumner till vänster om den "
"aktuella markeringen. Antalet infogade kolumner motsvarar antalet kolumner "
"som markeringen omfattar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1400
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Rows</guimenuitem> — The <guimenuitem>Rows</guimenuitem> menu "
"item will insert rows above the current selection. The number of rows "
"inserted will be equal to the number of rows spanned by the current "
"selection."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Rader</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet "
"<guimenuitem>Rader</guimenuitem> infogar rader ovanför den aktuella "
"markeringen. Antalet infogade rader motsvarar antalet rader som markeringen "
"omfattar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1410
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Sheet</guimenuitem> — The <guimenuitem>Sheet</guimenuitem> menu"
" item allows the user to insert a worksheet immediately following the "
"current sheet."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Blad</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet "
"<guimenuitem>Blad</guimenuitem> infogar ett kalkylblad direkt efter det "
"aktuella kalkylbladet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1425
msgid ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">2</emphasis> Insert an object into the worksheet or "
"content into the current cell."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">2</emphasis> Infoga ett objekt i kalkylbladet eller "
"innehåll i den aktuella cellen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1431
msgid ""
"The menu items insert sheet objects into the worksheet or insert content "
"into the current cell."
msgstr ""
"Menyobjekten infogar objekt i kalkylbladet eller innehåll i den aktuella "
"cellen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1438
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Graph...</guimenuitem> — The "
"<guimenuitem>Graph...</guimenuitem> menu item will allow a user to insert a "
"graphic plot of data. This menu item will launch the graph druid. Graphing "
"in <application>Gnumeric</application> is explained in <xref "
"linkend=\"chapter-graphs\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Graf…</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet "
"<guimenuitem>Graf…</guimenuitem> låter dig infoga en grafisk återgivning av "
"data. Det öppnar diagramguiden. Diagram i "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> beskrivs i <xref linkend=\"chapter-"
"graphs\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1449
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Image...</guimenuitem> — The "
"<guimenuitem>Image...</guimenuitem> menu item will allow a user to insert a "
"graphic object containing the image from an external file. The use of images"
" in <application>Gnumeric</application> is explained in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-graphics-images\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Bild…</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet "
"<guimenuitem>Bild…</guimenuitem> låter dig infoga ett grafiskt objekt med en"
" bild från en extern fil. Bilder i <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"beskrivs i <xref linkend=\"sect-graphics-images\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1487
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Function</guimenuitem> — This menu item opens a dialog to allow"
" the user to enter a mathematical formula into the cell. The function dialog"
" includes the names and a brief explanation of all the available functions."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Funktion</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet öppnar en dialogruta där "
"du kan skriva in en matematisk formel i cellen. Dialogrutan listar alla "
"tillgängliga funktioner med namn och en kort beskrivning."
